 charge. The US almost didn't get the Seltos in the first place; the first-generation model was designed with China in mind. Seltos take two is more considered, and also a little more substantial. The new body with its Telluride-like design cues has been stretched, mostly in the wheelbase. That said, at 174.4 inches (4,430 mm) long, 72 inches (1,829 mm) wide, and 64.9 inches (1,648 mm) tall, it's still a subcompact, one segment smaller than something like a Toyota RAV4 or Mazda CX-5 . Kia is offering a choice of three different powertrain variants. The 1.6 L hybrid is the one we're most interested in. But that version won't be in showrooms until Q4 this year; don't expect an Ars first drive of the hybrid Seltos until early next year. Or any other details in this first drive reportâ€”the hybrid Seltos is still undergoing its EPA certification, and Kia isn't prepared to talk power, torque, or efficiency until that's done and dusted. Read full article Commentsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jIOlDki5H9cxgZjExnci_JznblhgpuoDJns6FLc-xoQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxB2027 Kia Seltos first drive gives you plenty of SUV for not much $ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;bljuj_0tcUbFEoCk91XkqbOWAlWDVBw1V354n9Jj-Aoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cpTzmm0IDqGAFzrxbXjLLtwYSG5UMwdFGDrxrmY56K4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxfhttps://arstechnica.com/cars/2026/07/2027-kia-seltos-first-drive-telluride-vibes-in-a-smaller-package/ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5ckV9oy2BmlPqPixVQaeY9foxXwc7688YCqTIxiE67Mƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx@2027-kia-seltos-first-drive-gives-you-plenty-of-suv-for